# Alpha-blend sample (v3.0 Phase 4): a tinted transparent panel
# (`alpha blend`, opacity 0.45) in front of two opaque objects.
# Blend-mode triangles are excluded from the opaque visibility
# pass and composited afterwards, sorted back-to-front, in
# linear space by the v3 renderer's transparent pass.
scene "alpha-blend" size 640 480 background black
camera at 0 1 9 look 0 0 0 fov 60
light directional dir -0.5 -1 -0.7 strength 1.2
cube left red at -2 0 -2 size 3
sphere right blue at 2 0 -2 radius 1.6
plane panel orange at 0 0 0 size 6 alpha blend opacity 0.45
render
